Require changes

Set Shell "zsh"
Set Theme "Catppuccin Macchiato"
Set FontSize 16
Set Width 1280
Set Height 760
Set Padding 18
Set Framerate 20
Set TypingSpeed 25ms

Sleep 1s

Type "changes interactive --no-symbols --no-calls --no-groups --quiet"
Enter
Wait+Screen /changes/
Sleep 2s

Ctrl+H
Tab
Wait+Screen /reject an empty bearer/
Sleep 1s
Space
Type "j"
Space
Sleep 2s

Type "g"
Wait+Screen /enter save/
Sleep 3s
Type "j"
Space
Sleep 2s
Enter
Wait+Screen /Write results/
Sleep 3s
Enter
Sleep 2s

Ctrl+L
Sleep 1s
Ctrl+H
Shift+Tab
Sleep 2s
Type "d"
Sleep 2s
Type "?"
Wait+Screen /click \/ wheel/
Sleep 3s
Escape
Sleep 3s
Type "q"
